   f['cleanup']='The extra +10 penetration lasts at most 180 days. Withdraw the Network also removes this separate +10 receipt, in addition to its existing -20, and removes Forward Operational Planning. Crisis cancellation does the same. Successful resolution consumes the receipt so no later double subtraction occurs.'
   f['description']='A prepared network strengthens the coup attempt for 180 days. Withdrawing support also withdraws this preparation. Cypriot safeguards can still defeat the attempt.'
